{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_08",
  "title": "滲透作戰",
  "storyCode": "OD-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b93f0566f6dc74f498d6f28ebd3e98a23f579d0283c8b14d0405065e8f814e2d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "巡林者的地圖只畫到這裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "接下來就只能靠我們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這個洞穴......沒想到這麼大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這麼來看，整個鎮子的地下都是空的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "爆炸物沒問題吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......安全屋裡威力最大的那一批都在這裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "希望Lord的計劃有效。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "恐怕沒有那麼簡單，看那邊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "......希望不是我想的那種......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畸變體感染者",
      "text": "嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這是......人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畸變體感染者",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "不管它是什麼，它會死，就夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "現在不管出現什麼鬼東西我都不會覺得奇怪了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "不要纏鬥，儘量突破，我們沒有時間浪費在這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......為什麼長泉的地下會有一個這樣的設施？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "寇恩......這裡是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我就知道！我*粗口*就知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "原來大部分實驗室都被傳送到這裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "現在想想，都是我們太大意了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "在這個鎮子上生活了這麼久，竟然毫無察覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這件事情的背後，就是那個瘋子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這是什麼味道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "還能是什麼，死亡的味道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "保持警惕，跟緊點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這都是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "籠子？這麼多籠子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "全都是屍體......人和動物混在一起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "這都是列維•克里奇科的傑作，此人的瘋狂和殘忍超乎常人想像。怪我當初還想過活捉，就應該一槍打穿他的腦門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "一般的瘋子還做不到這麼恐怖的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......籠子裡有個活人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "看看誰來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "是那個德魯奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "這混帳東西就是燒成灰我也認得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "啊，是你們，是那群雇傭兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "很高興看到你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "我知道我們之前有過很多矛盾......但是這些矛盾都可以擱置一邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "我猜你們要找那個學者......我知道他在哪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "我們現在有一個共同的敵人，在這件事上我們應該能夠合作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "這人的臉皮厚得讓我感到噁心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "那邊那個菲林，我知道你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "你的身手還是很好認的，哥倫比亞的雇傭兵市場上能打聽到很多消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "你是個殺手，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "羅德島願意雇傭你，說明即便是羅德島也有很多髒活要做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "比起其他人，你一定更懂得權衡利弊，我們來談談吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......閉嘴，或者我讓你閉嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "真是遺憾，我以為像你這樣的人會更加務實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "把籠子打開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "什麼......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "沒事，把籠子打開就行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "這就對了，大家都是明白人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "是，我當然是個明白人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "等等，你要做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "你！你瘋了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "救命......救......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "救......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "別......別打了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "呵，你還能說話，說明打得還不夠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "這一拳，是為了米亞羅醫生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "好了好了，別打了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "你下手也太狠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "怎麼......你還同情他?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "好傢伙，你都快把他打死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "臉都打變形了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "省點力氣吧，我們還有事要幹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "你說得對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......噗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "沒什麼，只是感覺心情舒暢了很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "沒錯，我也舒暢多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這傢伙被關在這裡，看起來也是被列維算計了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我一點都不覺得驚訝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......沒看到有人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......謹慎一點，可能會有埋伏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "瞧瞧是誰來了，我的實驗寶地又有訪客了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "許久不見，虹彩小隊的朋友們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "你們來得正是時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "不......你們每次來得都正是時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "不要費勁了，這面玻璃是防彈的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "我對你的果斷表示贊許，板機扣得毫不猶豫，不等人體面地結束開場白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "但讓我們回到這場戲來吧，美好的開場需要優秀的觀眾，美好的開場也需要完整的開幕致辭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "今天是讚頌造物主偉業的日子，而這個造物主，就是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "造物主？你還真敢給自己的臉上貼金。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "你這個喪心病狂的瘋子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "瘋子......呵。庸人最喜歡用這個詞來形容他們不能理解的思維和想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "看看這個世界，看看這個世界！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "截然不同的化學性質......完全顛覆的物理法則......科學之花要在探索和懷疑中綻放，這個充滿未知的大地就是最好的土壤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "而現在，我成功了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "你們看到了嗎？你們感到了嗎？就在那乍看極為類似的表象之下，萬事萬物運作的原理全然不同！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "這是生命的進化，這是存在的反覆運算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "源石就是這個世界的真理，你們應當接納它，而不是恐懼它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "歡迎來到未來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "你對自己的所作所為就沒有一絲道德上的抵觸嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "人命在你看來究竟是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "人性本質軟弱，善惡是軟弱前提下的主觀定義，老生常談的愧疚感則不過是我們大腦產生的無數種認知信號之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "而我所追求的科學，從來不會被這種軟弱與模糊的概念所左右。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "不要自欺欺人了，即便是在這個世界，你依然嘗試用你那種毫無意義的概念來束縛自己的思維。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "即便是電子資訊技術，核能源......這些技術最初的來源都是為了彼此更高效地互相殺戮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "難道你還想給科學添加一層新的定義？讓一切都符合你稚嫩的精神需求？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "愚昧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "但是我原諒你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "你們可以不明白，我允許你們不明白。思維滯後是一種普遍存在的愚昧，這不是你們的錯，我原諒你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "我的致辭結束了，除了原諒，我還要感謝諸位的耐心等待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "現在，讚美吧——讚美這種全新的生命形態。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "讚美——讚美——讚美！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "無論付出什麼代價，絕不能讓這個東西到地面上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "你們拖住它！我安裝炸彈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
